      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Three years ago. And high cholesterol, same time.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:29",
      "end_timestamp": "02:33",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Right, type 2 diabetes for three years, plus the high cholesterol. And you're managing with diet alone, no pills so far?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:36",
      "end_timestamp": "02:46",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Banana bread, I love banana bread, I won't hold that against you. Do you smoke at all?",
      "start_timestamp": "03:15",
      "end_timestamp": "03:23",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Never smoked.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:26",
      "end_timestamp": "03:28",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And alcohol, do you drink?",
      "start_timestamp": "03:29",
      "end_timestamp": "03:32",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "A couple of beers on the weekend.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:34",
      "end_timestamp": "03:38",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Blood pressure comes out at 134 over 82. A touch high, but I'd want it again before I worry. Step up here for me, please.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:05",
      "end_timestamp": "04:19",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Weight is 94 kilograms. Last year you were 90, so a few kilos have crept on over the winter. Now, take your sock off, I want to look at your feet.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:35",
      "end_timestamp": "04:53",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Good, sensation in both feet is normal. And the pulses at the ankles are strong, so the circulation looks fine.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:39",
      "end_timestamp": "05:49",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]",
        "physical_examination[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Very good. So here's my thinking. It looks like your blood sugar control is slipping, mostly from the winter routine, the extra rice and bread, and the walks stopping.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:54",
      "end_timestamp": "06:11",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Not yet. Let's get an accurate picture first. I'd like to order an HbA1c, which tells us the average of the last three months. We'll draw it today at the lab downstairs.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:18",
      "end_timestamp": "06:34",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'd also like a urine test for protein, since diabetes can affect the kidneys over the years. You can give that sample on your way out.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:41",
      "end_timestamp": "06:54",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[1]",
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "In the meantime, go back to walking, even twenty minutes after dinner, and try swapping half the rice for vegetables. Banana bread, one slice, not three.",
      "start_timestamp": "07:00",
      "end_timestamp": "07:13",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Tell her it's doctor's orders. Let's meet again in two weeks, when the results are back, and talk about whether medicine makes sense.",
      "start_timestamp": "07:19",
      "end_timestamp": "07:33",
      "supports": [
